<section class="dot-demo" aria-labelledby="dot-title"><h2 id="dot-title">共线性点图：方向与顺序</h2><p>原理示意：每个点表示一个虚构的同源基因对；横轴和纵轴为两条染色体上基因的顺序位置。</p><div class="stage"><svg viewBox="0 0 600 360" role="img" aria-labelledby="dot-svg-title dot-desc"><title id="dot-svg-title">同向与反向排列的锚点示意</title><desc id="dot-desc">同向排列的点从左下向右上，反向排列从左上向右下。</desc><path d="M90 30V285H550" fill="none" stroke="#849ba6" stroke-width="2"/><g stroke="#e1e8ed" stroke-width="1"><path d="M170 30V285 M250 30V285 M330 30V285 M410 30V285 M490 30V285 M90 65H550 M90 120H550 M90 175H550 M90 230H550"/></g><g id="dot-forward" fill="#197b73"><circle cx="170" cy="230" r="8"/><circle cx="250" cy="175" r="8"/><circle cx="330" cy="120" r="8"/><circle cx="410" cy="65" r="8"/></g><g id="dot-reverse" fill="#ae7543" opacity="0"><circle cx="170" cy="65" r="8"/><circle cx="250" cy="120" r="8"/><circle cx="330" cy="175" r="8"/><circle cx="410" cy="230" r="8"/></g><g fill="#17324d" font-size="17"><text x="255" y="330">染色体甲基因顺序 →</text><text x="25" y="218" transform="rotate(-90 25 218)">染色体乙基因顺序 →</text></g></svg></div><div><button type="button" data-dot="forward" aria-pressed="true">同向排列</button> <button type="button" data-dot="reverse" aria-pressed="false">反向排列</button> <button type="button" data-dot="reset">重置</button></div><p id="dot-explanation" aria-live="polite">同向排列的示意锚点从左下向右上延伸。</p><p>图仅表示顺序关系，不包含真实基因坐标。实际反向点带还应结合组装方向、染色体位置和同源证据判断。</p></section>
<script>
for(const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-dot]'))button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const selected=button.dataset.dot==='reset'?'forward':button.dataset.dot!;document.querySelector('#dot-forward')?.setAttribute('opacity',selected==='forward'?'1':'0');document.querySelector('#dot-reverse')?.setAttribute('opacity',selected==='reverse'?'1':'0');const explanation=document.querySelector('#dot-explanation');if(explanation)explanation.textContent=selected==='forward'?'同向排列的示意锚点从左下向右上延伸。':'反向排列的示意锚点从左上向右下延伸；还需结合原始证据判断其原因。';for(const item of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-dot]'))if(item.dataset.dot!=='reset')item.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(item.dataset.dot===selected));});
</script>
<style>.dot-demo{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:#f8fbfa;border-radius:12px;margin:32px 0}.stage{overflow-x:auto}.stage svg{width:100%;min-width:550px;height:auto}.dot-demo p{font-size:.9rem}.dot-demo button{margin:4px}.dot-demo button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--teal);color:#fff}</style>
